      en: ["The battle took place from July 4 to July 6, 907", "Margrave Luitpold of Bavaria was killed during the fighting", "Three Bavarian bishops and 19 counts perished in the conflict", "The Enns River became the western border of Hungary after 907", "Hungarian forces employed feigned retreat tactics effectively", "The Annales Iuvavenses record the destruction of the Bavarian army"],
