      en: ["The castle was likely built in the 12th century to monitor the Hron valley", "It was part of the defensive chain for central Slovak mining towns", "The architecture featured massive Gothic defensive stone structures", "Its destruction and decline occurred mainly during the 17th century", "Archaeological excavations revealed medieval pottery and metal artifacts", "The ruins now offer a wide view over the Zvolen Basin"],
